---
// Illustrative device-pairing card. Pairing is beta and needs an Ikenga server
// that you build and run yourself; Confirm and Cancel are sample controls.
---

<div class="pair" data-pair-card>
	<div class="pair-h">New device <span class="pill beta">Beta</span></div>
	<span class="pair-code">4KQ-9TM</span>
	<ul class="pair-phrase" aria-label="Four-word phrase">
		<li>ember</li>
		<li>river</li>
		<li>kola</li>
		<li>stone</li>
	</ul>
	<div class="pair-act">
		<button class="btn btn-demo" type="button" data-pair="confirm">Confirm</button>
		<button class="btn btn-quiet" type="button" data-pair="cancel">Cancel</button>
	</div>
	<p class="pair-state" aria-live="polite">Check that both screens show the same four words.</p>
</div>
<p class="illus">
	Illustrative card. Pairing needs an Ikenga server you build and run yourself; the desktop download does not include
	one. Nothing runs from this page.
</p>
